# View ▸ Readonly Mode: typing, Enter, a format command and Undo leave the
# document alone until it is turned off. With unsaved changes it asks
# first; Cancel stays editable, Enter Without Saving locks it as it is.
write @DIR@/doc.md Text here.\n
cmd openPath @DIR@/doc.md
wait 400
caret 0 4
cmd readonly
wait 200
check model.readonly && !model.modified
type  more
key Return
cmd strong
key Ctrl+Z
wait 200
check model.markdown() === "Text here.\n" && !model.modified
cmd sourceMode
wait 200
check !Ui.sourceMode
cmd readonly
wait 200
check !model.readonly
caret 0 4
type  more
wait 200
check model.modified
cmd readonly
wait 200
check dialog.visible && dialog.buttons.join() === "Save,Enter Without Saving,Cancel"
answer 2
wait 200
check !model.readonly
cmd readonly
wait 200
answer 1
wait 200
check model.readonly && model.modified
type  lost
dump @OUT@
